      "content": "It is extremely dangerous to take St. John's Wort or any decongestants alongside an MAOI. These substances can dangerously interact with your medication, potentially causing serious side effects or even a hypertensive crisis. You must *only* take medications and supplements approved by your prescribing physician. Do not attempt to mix any over-the-counter supplements with your new MAOI without explicit professional guidance.",
      "source": "target",
